      198.57,
      226.97,
      365.01,
      250.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CIVIL PROCEDURE CODE(CHAPTER 101)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.97,
      401.9,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.86,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Civil Procedure Code(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.9,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of this Act shall come into operationon such date as the Minister may appoint by Order publishedin the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      382.97,
      401.9,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "2. The Civil Procedure Code (Chapter 101) (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amendedby the substitution for the words \u201cSmall Claims Court\u201dwherever those words occur in any provision of the principalenactment, of the words \u201cSmall Claims Court\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      454.97,
      401.86,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "3. Chapter LXVI (sections 801 to 833B both inclusive)of the principal enactment is hereby repealed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      514.97,
      401.9,
      538.31
    ],
    "text": "4. The First Schedule to the principal enactment ishereby amended by the repeal of Form No. 136 thereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      570.89,
      401.88,
      594.23
    ],
    "text": "5. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
